        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a world where food falls from the sky and your survival depends on what you eat and how fast you eat it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble up 100 foods to unlock the phase exit, or take a risk and aim for 150 to earn a five-star score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the calories of each item, your character will gain or lose weight. Reach either extreme and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat wisely and act fast before you're swallowed by the rising tide of food, leftovers from what you skip or can't reach in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple gameplay, tasty challenge!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with keyboard and controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, text-free interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 levels with progressive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 different foods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music and environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer local for two players!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to clear levels while competing to see who eats the most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your calorie intuition and lightning reflexes. Can you maintain the perfect weight, dodge the food flood, and become the star of the feast?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a world where food falls from the sky and your survival depends on what you eat and how fast you eat it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble up 100 foods to unlock the phase exit, or take a risk and aim for 150 to earn a five-star score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the calories of each item, your character will gain or lose weight. Reach either extreme and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat wisely and act fast before you're swallowed by the rising tide of food, leftovers from what you skip or can't reach in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple gameplay, tasty challenge!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with keyboard and controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, text-free interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 levels with progressive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 different foods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music and environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer local for two players!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to clear levels while competing to see who eats the most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your calorie intuition and lightning reflexes. Can you maintain the perfect weight, dodge the food flood, and become the star of the feast?</p>",
        "short_description": "Food is your salvation and your downfall. Jump across platforms as you feast on the rain of food. Eat 100 to pass, and 150 to show off. Beware, too many or too few calories will kill you, and the rising tide, born of what you let fall, will swallow you whole.",
        "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain",
